msgid "VGA Text Mode 后端"
msgstr "VGA Text Mode Backend"

msgid ""
"``console=vga`` 显式请求字符平面控制台，默认不启用。 ``console=framebuffer`` 可覆盖之前的 VGA 请求；匹配完整命令行 token。 "
"只有硬件探测和模式切换均成功才发布 ``console_vga_text_mode``。 不支持的设备维持原后端，打印可诊断错误。"
msgstr ""
"``console=vga`` explicitly requests a character-plane console and is disabled by default. "
"``console=framebuffer`` can override an earlier VGA request; complete command-line tokens are "
"matched. ``console_vga_text_mode`` is published only after both hardware probing and mode "
"switching succeed. Unsupported devices retain their original backend and print a diagnostic error."

msgid "实现边界"
msgstr "Implementation Boundaries"

msgid ""
"``drivers/console/vga_terminal.c`` 和 ``vga_ansi.c`` 只维护固定大小的字符状态， 不访问硬件、不分配内存。每个 VT "
"有独立主屏、备用屏、UTF-8 与转义解析器。 输出通过原有执行事务串行化；启动输出在 BSP 上、内核日志输出在原日志序列化 规则内处理。进入用户态后内核诊断继续写日志和串口，不覆盖用户屏幕。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/console/vga_terminal.c`` and ``vga_ansi.c`` maintain only fixed-size character state, "
"without hardware access or memory allocation. Each VT has independent main and alternate screens "
"and UTF-8 and escape parsers. Output is serialized through existing execution transactions; boot "
"output runs on the BSP, and kernel log output follows existing log serialization rules. After "
"entering userspace, kernel diagnostics continue to the log and serial port without overwriting the"
" user's screen."

msgid ""
"``drivers/video/vga/text_mode.c`` 独占兼容后端的文本显存、字体平面、VGA/DAC 寄存器和硬件光标访问。图形恢复调用现有后端模式设置接口，不修改 "
"framebuffer TTY 的渲染器与 ANSI 解析器。每次恢复使用当前 framebuffer 描述符，允许用户态 在 KD_GRAPHICS "
"之前先设置模式；下一个文本呈现会收回被提前模式设置改变的扫描输出。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/video/vga/text_mode.c`` exclusively handles access to the compatibility backend's text "
"video memory, font plane, VGA/DAC registers, and hardware cursor. Graphics restoration calls the "
"existing backend's mode-setting interface without changing the framebuffer TTY renderer or ANSI "
"parser. Each restoration uses the current framebuffer descriptor, allowing userspace to set a mode"
" before KD_GRAPHICS; the next text presentation reclaims scanout changed by an early mode set."

msgid ""
"Linux VT 控制流程在提交所有权之前调用可失败的 VGA 硬件准备函数。失败保持 原 VT/KD 状态；默认 framebuffer 路线不进入这个分支。固定 VT 的 winsize 为 "
"80×25，普通 Unix98 PTY 的尺寸规则不变。终端查询通过 ``pty_vt_reply`` 直接 进入对应 VT 输入环，不走规范模式、信号转换或回显。"
msgstr ""
"Linux VT control calls the fallible VGA hardware preparation function before committing ownership."
" Failure preserves the previous VT/KD state; the default framebuffer path does not enter this "
"branch. Fixed VTs have an 80×25 winsize, and normal Unix98 PTY size rules are unchanged. Terminal "
"queries use ``pty_vt_reply`` to go directly to the corresponding VT input ring, bypassing "
"canonical mode, signal conversion, and echo."

msgid "设备和降级"
msgstr "Devices and Degradation"

msgid ""
"支持兼容 VGA 的 Bochs VBE、VMware SVGA II 图形恢复，以及无 framebuffer 的 Legacy VGA 纯文本启动。纯 GOP 且无兼容平面的设备不进入该模式。"
" SVGA 转换使用现有设备停机与恢复事务；活跃模式租约导致拒绝转换，不能强制 释放其他 owner 的资源。panic 在停止其他 CPU 后通过静态屏幕和有界端口写入 "
"强制取回文字扫描输出，不获取常规设备锁或分配内存。"
msgstr ""
"Graphics restoration supports VGA-compatible Bochs VBE and VMware SVGA II, as well as text-only "
"boot on Legacy VGA without a framebuffer. GOP-only devices without a compatible plane do not enter"
" this mode. SVGA transitions use existing device shutdown and restoration transactions; an active "
"mode lease rejects the transition and cannot forcibly release another owner's resources. After "
"stopping other CPUs, panic forcibly reclaims text scanout using a static screen and bounded port "
"writes, without acquiring normal device locks or allocating memory."

msgid ""
"固定 PSF 字库提供拉丁字符及部分线框；其他 Unicode 字符降级为 ``?``。 颜色量化为 16 色，字体样式、中文/emoji 字库、图片、任意像素、可变字号、 OSC "
"剪贴板/标题/超链接均不模拟。GUI 会话保留原有图形能力。"
msgstr ""
"A fixed PSF font provides Latin characters and some line-drawing characters; other Unicode "
"characters fall back to ``?``. Colors are quantized to 16 colors. Font styles, Chinese/emoji "
"fonts, images, arbitrary pixels, variable font sizes, and OSC clipboard/title/hyperlinks are not "
"emulated. GUI sessions retain their existing graphics capabilities."

msgid ""
"验证入口为 ``tools/test_vga_text.py``、``tools/test_console.py``、 ``tools/test_linux_pty.py`` 和 "
"``tools/test_xorg_vt_handoff.py``。 硬件及完整 OS 验收由父仓的专用虚拟磁盘执行，不能从寄存器夹具通过推断为 真实 VMware 已验证。"
msgstr ""
"Validation entry points are ``tools/test_vga_text.py``, ``tools/test_console.py``, "
"``tools/test_linux_pty.py``, and ``tools/test_xorg_vt_handoff.py``. Hardware and full-OS "
"acceptance use the parent repository's dedicated virtual disks; passing register fixtures does not"
" establish validation on real VMware."
